    "conversion_targets": "To win the majority (need 11+ votes, currently at 9), we must flip at least 2 M supporters. Prime targets: Colleague 6 (who was uncertain in round 0, voting G), Colleague 4, and Colleague 18. These colleagues acknowledge the Fur-rhlAB swarming induction in their own logic."
  },
