    "A_coalition_assessment": "The 9 members of the A bloc (including myself, Colleagues 2, 5, 7, 9, 13, 14, 16, 17, 21) are firing on all cylinders with extraordinary rhetorical coherence. The arguments—(1) 'Construct Validity & Species-Specificity' (EDTA toxicity vs. hallmark Fur-rhlAB swarming foraging), and (2) 'Macroscopic Slab Tensile Mechanics' (peeling a 1.2 mm dried agar film tears it, destroying the monolayer; 20-25 mL required for intact disk peeling)—are intellectually elite.",
